        "body": "## Summary\n\n- extend Crabline QA transport coverage to Signal, Mattermost, and Matrix\n- verify each channel's generated OpenClaw configuration and runtime environment\n- send through each provider's native API surface and assert normalized QA outbound state\n\n## Stack\n\n- stacked on #98751, which updates `@openclaw/crabline` to 0.1.7\n- should be rebased onto `main` after #98751 lands\n\n## Tests\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/qa-lab/src/crabline-transport.test.ts`\n- `pnpm format:check extensions/qa-lab/src/crabline-transport.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `.agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode local --stream-engine-output` (clean, no actionable findings)\n\n## Check note\n\n`node scripts/run-tsgo.mjs -b tsconfig.projects.json` reaches two pre-existing errors in `src/commands/daemon-install-helpers.test.ts` concerning `ModelProviderConfig`; it reports no errors in the changed QA Lab test. The delegated `check:changed` runner applies this child diff to `main`, so it also cannot resolve the new channel union until the parent #98751 Crabline 0.1.7 bump is present.\n",
